msgstr "https://pdfformsfiller.org/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: pdf-forms-for-contact-form-7.php:5
msgid "Build Contact Form 7 forms from PDF forms. Get PDFs auto-filled and attached to email messages and/or website responses on form submission."
msgstr "Crie formulários do Contact Form 7 a partir de formulários PDF. Obtenha PDF preenchidos automaticamente e anexados às mensagens de email e/ou às respostas do site no envio do formulário."

